  abilityDesc: 30 combo massive Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), enormously boosts critical damage for 3 turns, adds 1 extra action within
    the same turn, enormously boosts OD gauge, enormously boosts Atk relative to
    Def for 3 turns & activates Water barrier
